{"name":"Praka","status":"ok","title":"Praka","pageId":83301,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Praka\" title=\"Category:Maps of Praka\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Praka</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL:M_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL:M-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ostel\" title=\"Ostel\">Ostel</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damara\" title=\"Damara\">Damara</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11,000 in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Praka\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Praka\">Inhabitants of  Praka</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Praka</b> was one of the larger cities in the <a href=\"/wiki/Ostel\" title=\"Ostel\">Barony of Ostel</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Damara\" title=\"Damara\">Damara</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL:M_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL:M-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Praka?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Praka was known for its stout outer walls and mighty towers.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Praka?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Historically, <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2VfUHJha2E/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"House Praka (page does not exist)\">House Praka</span> was beloved by the citizens and the Baron of Ostel would even be appointed as Damara's steward during times of absence from the king. However, in 1357 Praka was ruled by <a href=\"/wiki/Sylvia_Praka\" title=\"Sylvia Praka\">Baroness Sylvia</a>, a puppet of <a href=\"/wiki/Zhengyi\" title=\"Zhengyi\">Zhengyi</a> who was despised by all.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Praka?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Second in size only to mighty <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Heliogabalus\" title=\"Heliogabalus\">Heliogabalus</a>, Praka's population in 1357 DR was 11,000.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Many skilled artists and craftsmen made their home in Praka. Inspiration from their skills could be seen throughout the city.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Praka?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Praka?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-TBL-p29-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-5\">1.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL-p29_1-6\">1.6</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/R.A._Salvatore\" title=\"R.A. Salvatore\">R.A. Salvatore</a> (1989). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Bloodstone_Lands_(sourcebook)\" title=\"The Bloodstone Lands (sourcebook)\">The Bloodstone Lands</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Elizabeth_T._Danforth\" title=\"Elizabeth T. Danforth\">Elizabeth T. Danforth</a>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 29. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-88038-771-8\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-88038-771-8\">0-88038-771-8</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-TBL:M-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL:M_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL:M_2-1\">2.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/R.A._Salvatore\" title=\"R.A. Salvatore\">R.A. Salvatore</a> (1989). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Bloodstone_Lands_(sourcebook)\" title=\"The Bloodstone Lands (sourcebook)\">The Bloodstone Lands (Map)</a></i>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>). ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-88038-771-8\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-88038-771-8\">0-88038-771-8</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260517033656\nCache expiry: 25